<link>https://ashetty612.github.io/teach-me-feed-a44f2c84/episodes/pearls-10--mrna-vaccines-2026-11-02.html</link><description><![CDATA[mRNA vaccines deliver genetic instructions (mRNA) to cells, prompting them to produce specific antigens, which then trigger an immune response. This cell-free manufacturing process allows for rapid vaccine development and quick adaptation to new variants by simply changing the genetic sequence.<br/><a href="https://ashetty612.github.io/teach-me-feed-a44f2c84/episodes/pearls-10--mrna-vaccines-2026-11-02.html">Show notes, chapters, transcript, self-test</a>]]></description>
